 the Hagur Kingdom spends her days completing difficult mission after difficult mission with her unparalleled skills in disguise and combat arts. However, following her boss's betrayal, she revised her life plan: to live a normal, happy life as a regular citizen by the name of Victoria in the nearby kingdom of Ashberry. Unexpectedly, her first happy day of her new life as \"Victoria\" was marked by coincidentally becoming the guardian of a certain girl and beginning to meet many people. On the other hand, shadows of assailants approach the talented Victoria at the behest of the Second Prince with an interest in Victoria's strength, and the organisation—!?","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/3b33635c-e74b-4a22-8933-4d9483f560ce/6a734beb-eef0-4b7e-9786-ebc16c1518c7.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.64,"follows":2372,"listAt":"2026-10-21T07:08:19.347Z","chapters":[{"id":"4b5ea86a-c321-4b67-a0d2-9b16aa165062","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2023-10-22T09:25:55+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:09:00.940Z"},"576d59fb-1885-4642-81ad-93b58dd5e57f":{"id":"576d59fb-1885-4642-81ad-93b58dd5e57f","title":"Eroica Yori Ai wo Komete","altTitle":"From Eroica with Love","description":"What happens when a gay art thief and a conservative NATO officer cross paths? Disaster, of course. \nDorian is an aristocrat, a thief, and a hedonist; Klaus is a duty-driven espionage agent with no patience for fools.\n\nFollow them as they chase each other across the globe – from Britain to Baghdad, from Alaska to Alexandria or Moscow to Madrid. \nSpectacular locations and non-stop adventures await!","year":1976,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Action","Psychologica